<p class="lead">Tea growing is a cornerstone of the Kijura economy. The area is served by two major tea factories: <strong>TAMTECO Tea Factory</strong> and <strong>Kamusanga Tea Factory</strong>, which process green leaf from thousands of smallholder farmers in the region.</p>
<p>Tea cultivation provides employment and income for many households in Kijura Town Council and surrounding sub-counties. The crop thrives in the area's altitude, rainfall and fertile soils.</p>
